    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Magical Girl Dash</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485070/extras/7861569d0bef40fa0ab090001075072f.avif?t=1705201665\" /></span><br><br>Magical Girl Dash is a retro arcade where you control Sophie, a normal student, but secretly she is also a magical girl fighting against evil forces that threaten the world! Defeat alien cats swarming throughout the city in a runner style game. Sophie have 2 special moves, a long range magical attack and a powerful short distance klck. Watch out as some enemies may only be defeat if one of the two types of attack!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Run and Shoot - run and jump, dodge and shoot. Keep running and increasing your score for the longer time you can manage while you shoot evil alien cats with your magical powers. <br></li><li>Cute Magical Girl Game - Style inspired on the classic genre of Magical Girl. Do you have a never ending passion of Sailor Moon, Precure, Card Captors Sakura and other magical girl related media? If yes you will definitely enjoy Magical Girl Dash!<br><br></li><li>Save the Bakery - Evil aliens stole all the recipes from Sophie's favorite bakery. This is a great disaster! Help her finding all recipes and protect the bakery from bankruptcy at all costs!<br><br></li><li>Retro Art - Charming and beautiful 16-bit pixel art style.<br><br></li><li>Online and Local Highscore - Defeat enemies, collect stars and find sweets to increase your score. Try to beat your personal score and aim for the global highscore.<br><br></li><li>Multiple powerups - find powerups that makes the magical attacks more powerful! Triple shot, homing bullet, large shot. Find as many as you can to increase your firepower and chances of survival!<br></li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485070/extras/3488ea836c56117aecf16eda12c04acd.avif?t=1705201665\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Magical Girl Dash</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485070/extras/7861569d0bef40fa0ab090001075072f.avif?t=1705201665\" /></span><br><br>Magical Girl Dash is a retro arcade where you control Sophie, a normal student, but secretly she is also a magical girl fighting against evil forces that threaten the world! Defeat alien cats swarming throughout the city in a runner style game. Sophie have 2 special moves, a long range magical attack and a powerful short distance klck. Watch out as some enemies may only be defeat if one of the two types of attack!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Run and Shoot - run and jump, dodge and shoot. Keep running and increasing your score for the longer time you can manage while you shoot evil alien cats with your magical powers. <br></li><li>Cute Magical Girl Game - Style inspired on the classic genre of Magical Girl. Do you have a never ending passion of Sailor Moon, Precure, Card Captors Sakura and other magical girl related media? If yes you will definitely enjoy Magical Girl Dash!<br><br></li><li>Save the Bakery - Evil aliens stole all the recipes from Sophie's favorite bakery. This is a great disaster! Help her finding all recipes and protect the bakery from bankruptcy at all costs!<br><br></li><li>Retro Art - Charming and beautiful 16-bit pixel art style.<br><br></li><li>Online and Local Highscore - Defeat enemies, collect stars and find sweets to increase your score. Try to beat your personal score and aim for the global highscore.<br><br></li><li>Multiple powerups - find powerups that makes the magical attacks more powerful! Triple shot, homing bullet, large shot. Find as many as you can to increase your firepower and chances of survival!<br></li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485070/extras/3488ea836c56117aecf16eda12c04acd.avif?t=1705201665\" /></span>",
